  <div id="sutta">
  
            <h4 id="thag2.47" class="h1">Thag 2:47  Anūpama</h4>
            <div class="verse">
              <p>Coming into the conceit of delight, the mind</p>
              <p>impales itself on a stake.</p>
              <p>Wherever’s a stake, a chopping block,</p>
              <p>there, only there, you turn.</p>
              <p class="v1"><em>You,</em> mind, I call an unlucky die.</p>
              <p class="v2"><em>You,</em> I call a mind-traitor.</p>
              <p>You’ve gained a Teacher hard to gain.</p>
              <p>Don’t urge me on to my loss.</p>
            </div><!--end verse-->
      </div><!--end:sutta-->
    </div><!--end:content-->
    
